    longDescription: "The earth opens up her secrets to your perceptions. Prerequisites: Echoes of Stone, character level 9th, oread. Benefit: You gain a limited form of tremorsense. As a move action, you become aware of all creatures within 15 feet that are in contact with the ground at that moment.",
