    prerequisitesText: "—",
    shortDescription: "Spell fully affects incorporeal and ethereal creatures",
    longDescription: "Your spells breach the gulf between dimensions, sending ghostly emanations into the ether. Benefit: An ectoplasmic spell has full effect against incorporeal or ethereal creatures. An ectoplasmic spell uses up a spell slot one level higher than the spell's actual level.",
