    prerequisitesText: "Str 15, natural weapons, base attack bonus +6",
    shortDescription: "Natural weapons treated as magic and silver",
    longDescription: "Who needs magic weapons? Eldritch tricks are no match for your bestial ferocity. Prerequisites: Str 15, natural weapons, base attack bonus +6. Benefit: You natural weapons are considered both magic and silver for purpose of overcoming damage reduction.",
