    prerequisitesText: "Elf",
    shortDescription: "Reroll miss chance due to concealment when using a bow",
    longDescription: "Your sharp eyesight makes difficult shots easier. Prerequisite: Elf. Benefit: If you miss due to concealment when making a ranged attack with a longbow or shortbow (including composite bows), you can reroll your miss chance roll one time to see if you actually hit.",
