    prerequisitesText: "Hero's Fortune",
    shortDescription: "Have a chance to retain spent hero points",
    longDescription: "To others, it seems that you always have a bit of luck around you. Prerequisite: Hero's Fortune. Benefit: Whenever you spend a hero point to reroll a die roll or to grant yourself a bonus before a die roll is made, there is a chance that the hero point is not spent. Whenever you spend a hero point, roll a d20. If the result is greater than 15, the hero point is not spent. You cannot use this feat when you cheat death.",
