    shortDescription: "Gain attack bonus and damage from charging with a readied melee attack",
    longDescription: "When the animal you're lashed to charges, you use its momentum in your own attack. Prerequisites: Horn Rider, base attack bonus +1. Benefit: Whenever you're lashed into a horn harness and you ready an action to make a melee attack against the target of a charge made by the creature you're lashed to, you gain the attack bonus for charging and your attack deals double damage (or triple damage with a lance). This benefit does not stack with the benefit of Spirited Charge.",
