    longDescription: "You can use your hydraulic push to disarm or trip. Prerequisites: Hydraulic push spell-like ability, undine. Benefit: You may use hydraulic push to attempt a bull rush, disarm, dirty trick (blind or dazzle, see ), or trip combat maneuver. Each time you use hydraulic push, you must decide which of the allowed combat maneuvers you want to perform. You may use this feat with your hydraulic push racial spell-like ability, your class-granted use of hydraulic push, or any hydraulic push spells you cast, but not with magic items or other external sources that use that spell. Normal: Hydraulic push can only be used to make a bull rush combat maneuver.",
