    longDescription: "You can use two occult skill unlocks more often. Prerequisite: Psychic Sensitivity or the ability to cast psychic spells. Benefit: Choose two occult skill unlocks. You can use each of those one additional time per day (or per week, in the case of automatic writing). You must have at least 1 rank in the skills associated with the chosen occult skill unlocks.",
